[{:db/id "f7dc7484-013b-5097-9937-5df5cca67819" :answer/id #uuid "f7dc7484-013b-5097-9937-5df5cca67819" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6x{sin}^{2}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1)\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3979ed87-af85-57db-8316-21223ec16943" :answer/id #uuid "3979ed87-af85-57db-8316-21223ec16943" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x{sin}^{2}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1)\\,{cos}^{2}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e2c86454-1fbf-57d8-9fab-f0e9a82e9af9" :answer/id #uuid "e2c86454-1fbf-57d8-9fab-f0e9a82e9af9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x{sin}^{2}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1)\\,{cos}^{2}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5326b014-bdff-590c-91fd-da791559ff94" :answer/id #uuid "5326b014-bdff-590c-91fd-da791559ff94" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2x{sin}^{2}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1)\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "2ac2a3d6-1261-55ae-9429-ab0a45e319bf" :answer/id #uuid "2ac2a3d6-1261-55ae-9429-ab0a45e319bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6x{sin}^{3}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1)\\,{cos}^{3}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1)" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a31723c2-df16-5a29-a9cf-4ab545f80f99" :answer-field/id #uuid "a31723c2-df16-5a29-a9cf-4ab545f80f99" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["f7dc7484-013b-5097-9937-5df5cca67819" "3979ed87-af85-57db-8316-21223ec16943" "e2c86454-1fbf-57d8-9fab-f0e9a82e9af9" "5326b014-bdff-590c-91fd-da791559ff94" "2ac2a3d6-1261-55ae-9429-ab0a45e319bf"] :answer-field/correct "f7dc7484-013b-5097-9937-5df5cca67819" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "2168b13d-cc27-5e92-a481-beee5381eccc" :question/id #uuid "2168b13d-cc27-5e92-a481-beee5381eccc" :question/problem "Find ${f}^{′}(x)$ when $f(x)={sin}^{3}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we express $f$ as the composite function\n\n$$\nf={u}^{3},\\,u=\\operatorname{sin}⁡v,\\,v=1{x}^{2}-1.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}=3{u}^{2},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}v}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡v,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=2x.\n$$\n\nApplying now the chain rule twice, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}v}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =3{u}^{2}\\cdot (\\operatorname{cos}⁡v)\\cdot 2x \\\\  & =3(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1))^{2}\\cdot (\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1))\\cdot 2x \\\\  & =6x{sin}^{2}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(1{x}^{2}-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["a31723c2-df16-5a29-a9cf-4ab545f80f99"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "6fd77f99-da27-58dd-a347-1c31d50cedc5" :answer/id #uuid "6fd77f99-da27-58dd-a347-1c31d50cedc5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{cot}^{3}⁡1{csc}^{2}⁡1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "2f2a9975-b462-5030-bd6f-57419893c0e5" :answer/id #uuid "2f2a9975-b462-5030-bd6f-57419893c0e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1{cot}^{3}⁡1{sec}^{2}⁡1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9249d26c-d661-549a-91a4-caf233a82221" :answer/id #uuid "9249d26c-d661-549a-91a4-caf233a82221" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4{cot}^{2}⁡1{csc}^{2}⁡1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "af8ef9cf-cd77-54c5-ad2b-ba9478fe6d6e" :answer/id #uuid "af8ef9cf-cd77-54c5-ad2b-ba9478fe6d6e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\operatorname{cot}⁡1{sec}^{2}⁡1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "22005ee4-41d0-5760-b893-f0fac19db39a" :answer/id #uuid "22005ee4-41d0-5760-b893-f0fac19db39a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4{cot}^{3}⁡1{csc}^{2}⁡1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3abb3881-a4da-56ea-afd6-a57f4bafd656" :answer-field/id #uuid "3abb3881-a4da-56ea-afd6-a57f4bafd656" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["6fd77f99-da27-58dd-a347-1c31d50cedc5" "2f2a9975-b462-5030-bd6f-57419893c0e5" "9249d26c-d661-549a-91a4-caf233a82221" "af8ef9cf-cd77-54c5-ad2b-ba9478fe6d6e" "22005ee4-41d0-5760-b893-f0fac19db39a"] :answer-field/correct "6fd77f99-da27-58dd-a347-1c31d50cedc5" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "f751f15c-49b5-572a-960c-e6e9fe0fd73f" :question/id #uuid "f751f15c-49b5-572a-960c-e6e9fe0fd73f" :question/problem "Find ${f}^{′}(0)$ when $f(x)={cot}^{4}⁡(1x-1).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we express $f$ as the composite function\n\n$$\nf={u}^{4},\\,u=\\operatorname{cot}⁡v,\\,v=1x-1.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}=4{u}^{3},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}v}=-{csc}^{2}⁡v,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=1.\n$$\n\nApplying now the chain rule twice, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}v}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =4{u}^{3}\\cdot (-{csc}^{2}⁡v)\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =4(\\operatorname{cot}⁡(1x-1))^{3}\\cdot (-{csc}^{2}⁡(1x-1))\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-4{cot}^{3}⁡(1x-1){csc}^{2}⁡(1x-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we compute ${f}^{′}(0):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(0) & =-4{cot}^{3}⁡(1(0)-1){csc}^{2}⁡(1(0)-1) \\\\  & =-4{cot}^{3}⁡(-1){csc}^{2}⁡(-1) \\\\  & =-4(-{cot}^{3}⁡1){csc}^{2}⁡1 \\\\  & =4{cot}^{3}⁡1{csc}^{2}⁡1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["3abb3881-a4da-56ea-afd6-a57f4bafd656"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "5c23db35-1c82-59b5-adbb-2c1801e613c5" :answer/id #uuid "5c23db35-1c82-59b5-adbb-2c1801e613c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8{cot}^{3}⁡1{csc}^{2}⁡1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c4041f6b-566b-50c0-84f6-8e034c917e79" :answer/id #uuid "c4041f6b-566b-50c0-84f6-8e034c917e79" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2{cot}^{3}⁡1{sec}^{2}⁡1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "868c8189-a478-5120-ad8e-fdc97fe80ed5" :answer/id #uuid "868c8189-a478-5120-ad8e-fdc97fe80ed5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4{cot}^{2}⁡1{csc}^{2}⁡1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "607877ee-30d1-5662-a148-072bd2a65e8a" :answer/id #uuid "607877ee-30d1-5662-a148-072bd2a65e8a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8\\operatorname{cot}⁡1{sec}^{2}⁡1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6fbdb636-8a72-52ec-ab3b-ff891686c910" :answer/id #uuid "6fbdb636-8a72-52ec-ab3b-ff891686c910" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4{cot}^{3}⁡1{csc}^{2}⁡1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3ee0f43d-3c4a-51a8-975c-eb46b3a70f21" :answer-field/id #uuid "3ee0f43d-3c4a-51a8-975c-eb46b3a70f21" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["5c23db35-1c82-59b5-adbb-2c1801e613c5" "c4041f6b-566b-50c0-84f6-8e034c917e79" "868c8189-a478-5120-ad8e-fdc97fe80ed5" "607877ee-30d1-5662-a148-072bd2a65e8a" "6fbdb636-8a72-52ec-ab3b-ff891686c910"] :answer-field/correct "5c23db35-1c82-59b5-adbb-2c1801e613c5" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "c3baed33-1cfd-5982-8e88-c33747aa34cf" :question/id #uuid "c3baed33-1cfd-5982-8e88-c33747aa34cf" :question/problem "Find ${f}^{′}(0)$ when $f(x)={cot}^{4}⁡(2x-1).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we express $f$ as the composite function\n\n$$\nf={u}^{4},\\,u=\\operatorname{cot}⁡v,\\,v=2x-1.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}=4{u}^{3},\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}v}=-{csc}^{2}⁡v,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nApplying now the chain rule twice, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}v}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}x} \\\\  & =4{u}^{3}\\cdot (-{csc}^{2}⁡v)\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =4(\\operatorname{cot}⁡(2x-1))^{3}\\cdot (-{csc}^{2}⁡(2x-1))\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =-8{cot}^{3}⁡(2x-1){csc}^{2}⁡(2x-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow we compute ${f}^{′}(0):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(0) & =-8{cot}^{3}⁡(2(0)-1){csc}^{2}⁡(2(0)-1) \\\\  & =-8{cot}^{3}⁡(-1){csc}^{2}⁡(-1) \\\\  & =-8(-{cot}^{3}⁡1){csc}^{2}⁡1 \\\\  & =8{cot}^{3}⁡1{csc}^{2}⁡1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["3ee0f43d-3c4a-51a8-975c-eb46b3a70f21"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "e071ac82-c30e-510e-891d-7e6d4aab4fa3" :answer/id #uuid "e071ac82-c30e-510e-891d-7e6d4aab4fa3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6\\cos^{2} 2x\\sin 2x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "1578d2e7-e3c7-58ca-ae2c-e000eee7b584" :answer/id #uuid "1578d2e7-e3c7-58ca-ae2c-e000eee7b584" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-6\\cos^{2} x\\sin x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ba9b90a3-6e76-58c1-b372-848a72b05143" :answer/id #uuid "ba9b90a3-6e76-58c1-b372-848a72b05143" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\sin^{2} 2x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "31dbc390-d7ff-52b7-9554-7039ff3e33a7" :answer/id #uuid "31dbc390-d7ff-52b7-9554-7039ff3e33a7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\sin^{2} 2x\\cos 2x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "a6daa534-1144-57a1-bda8-9347e8f3c975" :answer/id #uuid "a6daa534-1144-57a1-bda8-9347e8f3c975" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\cos^{2} 2x\\sin 2x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e16ae766-5a2f-5472-aaef-e0f1cfc54863" :answer-field/id #uuid "e16ae766-5a2f-5472-aaef-e0f1cfc54863" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["e071ac82-c30e-510e-891d-7e6d4aab4fa3" "1578d2e7-e3c7-58ca-ae2c-e000eee7b584" "ba9b90a3-6e76-58c1-b372-848a72b05143" "31dbc390-d7ff-52b7-9554-7039ff3e33a7" "a6daa534-1144-57a1-bda8-9347e8f3c975"] :answer-field/correct "e071ac82-c30e-510e-891d-7e6d4aab4fa3" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "78f271bc-8d43-5a38-8524-01c52619086f" :question/id #uuid "78f271bc-8d43-5a38-8524-01c52619086f" :question/problem "Find $f^{′}(x)$ when $f(x) = \\cos^{3} 2x$." :question/worked-solution "First, we express $f$ as the composite function\n\n$$\nf=u^3,\\,u=\\cos v,\\,v=2x.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\mathrm{d}f}{\\mathrm{d}u}=3u^2,\\quad \\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}v}=-\\sin v,\\quad \\frac{\\mathrm{d}v}{\\mathrm{d}x}=2.\n$$\n\nApplying now the chain rule twice, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(x)&=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}f}{\\mathrm{d}u}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{d}u}{\\mathrm{d}v}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{d}v}{\\mathrm{d}x}\\\\\n&=3u^2\\cdot (-\\sin v)\\cdot 2\\\\\n&=-6\\cos^{2} 2x\\sin 2x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["e16ae766-5a2f-5472-aaef-e0f1cfc54863"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "3e198e28-7ad4-54be-9fe1-0ede79594f34" :answer/id #uuid "3e198e28-7ad4-54be-9fe1-0ede79594f34" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\sin^{2} 2x\\cos 2x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8aa31131-7bc2-5861-b733-db93afc59ee7" :answer/id #uuid "8aa31131-7bc2-5861-b733-db93afc59ee7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sin^{2} 2x\\cos 2x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e1e13535-c174-5ff3-a658-d532f5876d18" :answer/id #uuid "e1e13535-c174-5ff3-a658-d532f5876d18" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\sin^{2} x\\cos x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e0fffbf4-1840-5e14-8dd6-a5d71b97666c" :answer/id #uuid "e0fffbf4-1840-5e14-8dd6-a5d71b97666c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6\\sin 2x\\cos 2x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6b326e02-a18a-5405-9760-a7eadc21044f" :answer/id #uuid "6b326e02-a18a-5405-9760-a7eadc21044f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sin x\\cos x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "cb2277f3-ece1-5aa4-a6b5-143a44b7c878" :answer-field/id #uuid "cb2277f3-ece1-5aa4-a6b5-143a44b7c878" :answer-field/key 